.\" Manual page for rdp-session(8).  mdoc format.
.Dd May 23, 2026
.Dt RDP-SESSION 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm rdp-session
.Nd per-user session helper for the Remote Desktop Protocol server
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the unprivileged per-user component of the Remote Desktop
Protocol server.  It is started by
.Xr rdp-sessionmgr 8
after authentication, with one end of a backend RPC socket pre-opened
on a known file descriptor.  It launches
.Xr Xvfb 1
(or the configured X server), captures damaged regions with
.Xr XDamage 3 ,
injects input via the XTEST extension, bridges the X11 CLIPBOARD
selection to the
.Sy CLIPRDR
RDP channel, and runs the user's session script
.Pa ~/.xsession .
.Pp
Phase 0 placeholder; not yet implemented.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr rdpd 8 ,
.Xr rdp-sessionmgr 8
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Renaud Allard Aq Mt renaud@allard.it
.Sh BUGS
Not implemented in Phase 0.
